Kind: ablation
Issue: #963
Takes out: the words after a boot module's name, with a bundle loaded: the kernel publishes argv[0] and --bundle= alone again, so entry 68's `-f chora.conf' never reaches bootstrap, which reads bootstrap.conf and runs the default boot's tests on it instead of chora_test.
Run: --iommu intel --entry 68 600 -smp 4
Expect: act_test: started

